|ษออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออ Help ออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออป|
|บ    The loan, reservation and use forms                                       บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ      Tab, Down          next field         Shift-Tab, Up   previous field    บ|
|บ      PgUp, PgDn         first, last field                                    บ|
|บ      Enter, Ctrl-S      save               Esc             cancel            บ|
|บ      F4                 on For item / With item: choose it from a list       บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    A loan needs a borrower and a due date.  A reservation needs whom or      บ|
|บ    what it is for, or the item it is for; Until is optional.  A use needs    บ|
|บ    what it is used with, or the item, and has no due date.  Type the         บ|
|บ    item's ID, or text and F4 to choose it from the items holding it (text    บ|
|บ    left there is chosen when the form is saved); its maker and model show    บ|
|บ    after it.  Dates are typed as YYYY-MM-DD; a new row without a date out    บ|
|บ    starts today.  The quantity (1 unless changed) and the date out can be    บ|
|บ    set only on a new row, and no more units can be taken than the item       บ|
|บ    has available.  An item that is disposed of or installed in an            บ|
|บ    assembly cannot be lent, reserved or used.  Return or release in the      บ|
|บ    list ends a row.                                                          บ|
